{"id":"5b7ca526c5d0bb9a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-strengthened-liar.md","title":"否定为真型说谎者（保留旧文件名）","display":"df-strengthened-liar — 否定为真型说谎者（保留旧文件名）","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-strengthened-liar","aliases":["91-df-strengthened-liar","91-df-liar-star"],"display":"df-strengthened-liar — 否定为真型说谎者（保留旧文件名）","depends_on":["[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-strengthened-liar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-strengthened-liar</span><span>91-df-liar-star</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strengthened-liar — 否定为真型说谎者（保留旧文件名）"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" href=\"?note=ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" title=\"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth\">91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 使用经典逻辑并能对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 句法对角化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为一元谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T},\\mathrm{StrongLiar}_{S,T}\">\\(\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T},\\mathrm{StrongLiar}_{S,T}\\)</span> 是下述元性质；后者仅是保留旧链接的历史别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strengthened\\text{-}liar}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T}(\\lambda^*)\\coloneqq\\lambda^*\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\n[S\\vdash\\lambda^*\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda^*\\urcorner})],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{StrongLiar}_{S,T}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strengthened\\text{-}liar}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T}(\\lambda^*)\\coloneqq\\lambda^*\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\n[S\\vdash\\lambda^*\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda^*\\urcorner})],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{StrongLiar}_{S,T}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\lambda^*\\;\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T}(\\lambda^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\lambda^*\\;\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T}(\\lambda^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)=T(\\operatorname{neg}(x))\">\\(\\varphi(x)=T(\\operatorname{neg}(x))\\)</span> 使用对角引理即得存在性。这里断言的是“我的否定为真”，即 falsity liar，不能仅因调用负真理信息就称为 strengthened liar。\n通常“加强”说谎者针对“我不真（包括真值未定义）”的表达资源；内部否定在三值逻辑中不表达这种二值的元层“不真”。原书 §20.3 讨论增加表达资源的困难，并没有把本式命名为加强说谎者。\n若经典背景还证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda^*\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\lambda^*\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda^*\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\lambda^*\\)</span>，则立即矛盾。仅凭本节点的 PA 可证对角等价，不能直接指定其强 Kleene 真值；须给出对角句的语法实现再分析。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1、§5.3–§6 的编码与对角化；§20.3，印刷页 286–290；命名纠正及所列存在性为本目录辅助定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth","status":"resolved","id":"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T},\\mathrm{StrongLiar}_{S,T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strengthened\\text{-}liar}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T}(\\lambda^*)\\coloneqq\\lambda^*\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\n[S\\vdash\\lambda^*\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda^*\\urcorner})],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{StrongLiar}_{S,T}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\lambda^*\\;\\mathrm{FalsityLiar}_{S,T}(\\lambda^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)=T(\\operatorname{neg}(x))","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda^*\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\lambda^*","display":false}],"bytes":1939,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-strengthened-liar]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-strengthened-liar]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-